{"framework":"vue","displayName":"Cell Features ▸ Async values · Standard example · Vue 3","tier":2,"engine":"container","sandpackTemplate":null,"sandpackEnvironment":null,"container":"vue","htWrappers":["@handsontable/vue3"],"entry":"/src/main.ts","htmlEntry":"/index.html","devCommand":"pnpm exec vite --host 0.0.0.0 --port 5173","buildCommand":"vite build","outputDir":"dist","outputGlob":null,"staticExport":false,"spaMode":false,"port":5173,"installCommand":"pnpm install","htCoreRange":"0.0.0-next-f03b17e-20261023","fileCount":5,"assets":[],"skipped":[],"files":{"/package.json":"{\n  \"name\": \"handsontable-vue-example\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"packageManager\": \"pnpm@10.34.5\",\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"handsontable\": \"0.0.0-next-f03b17e-20261023\",\n    \"@handsontable/vue3\": \"0.0.0-next-f03b17e-20261023\",\n    \"vue\": \"3.x\",\n    \"vite\": \"^5.4.0\",\n    \"@vitejs/plugin-vue\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"start\": \"vite\",\n    \"build\": \"vite build\"\n  }\n}","/vite.config.js":"import { defineConfig } from \"vite\";\nimport vue from \"@vitejs/plugin-vue\";\n\nexport default defineConfig({ plugins: [vue()], server: { allowedHosts: true } });","/index.html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <title>Handsontable Vue Example</title>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div id=\"example1\"></div>\n  <script type=\"module\" src=\"/src/main.ts\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>","/src/main.ts":"import { createApp } from \"vue\";\nimport App from \"./App.vue\";\ncreateApp(App).mount(\"#example1\");","/src/App.vue":"<script setup lang=\"ts\">\nimport { ref, useTemplateRef } from 'vue';\nimport { HotTable } from '@handsontable/vue3';\nimport { registerAllModules } from 'handsontable/registry';\nimport type { GridSettings } from 'handsontable/settings';\n\nregisterAllModules();\n\nconst products: Record<string, string> = {\n  'A-100': 'Desk lamp',\n  'B-200': 'Office chair',\n  'C-300': 'Standing desk',\n  'D-400': 'Monitor arm',\n};\n\n// A stand-in for a server request: it answers after a delay, and stops when the signal is aborted.\nfunction lookUpProduct(sku: string, signal: AbortSignal): Promise<string> {\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n    const timer = setTimeout(() => {\n      if (products[sku]) {\n        resolve(products[sku]);\n      } else {\n        reject(new Error(`Unknown SKU: ${sku}`));\n      }\n    }, 600 + Math.random() * 1400);\n\n    signal.addEventListener('abort', () => {\n      clearTimeout(timer);\n      reject(signal.reason);\n    });\n  });\n}\n\nconst hotRef = useTemplateRef<InstanceType<typeof HotTable>>('hotRef');\n\nfunction lookUpRows(fromRow: number, toRow: number) {\n  const hot = hotRef.value?.hotInstance;\n\n  hot?.getPlugin('asyncValues').setAsyncValues(fromRow, 1, toRow, 1, ({ physicalRow, signal }) => (\n    lookUpProduct(hot.getSourceDataAtCell(physicalRow, 'sku') as string, signal)\n  ), { dependsOn: ['sku'] });\n}\n\nfunction lookUpAll() {\n  lookUpRows(0, (hotRef.value?.hotInstance?.countRows() ?? 0) - 1);\n}\n\nconst hotSettings = ref<GridSettings>({\n  data: [\n    { sku: 'A-100', product: '' },\n    { sku: 'B-200', product: '' },\n    { sku: 'X-999', product: '' },\n    { sku: 'C-300', product: '' },\n    { sku: 'D-400', product: '' },\n  ],\n  columns: [\n    { data: 'sku', title: 'SKU' },\n    { data: 'product', title: 'Product', readOnly: true },\n  ],\n  colWidths: [120, 220],\n  rowHeaders: true,\n  height: 'auto',\n  asyncValues: true,\n  // Look the product up again when its SKU changes.\n  afterChange(changes) {\n    changes?.forEach(([row, prop]) => {\n      if (prop === 'sku') {\n        lookUpRows(row, row);\n      }\n    });\n  },\n  autoWrapRow: true,\n  autoWrapCol: true,\n  licenseKey: 'non-commercial-and-evaluation',\n});\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div class=\"example-controls-container\">\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button class=\"button button--primary\" @click=\"lookUpAll\">Look up products</button>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"example1\">\n    <HotTable ref=\"hotRef\" :settings=\"hotSettings\" />\n  </div>\n</template>"},"docsPath":"guides/cell-features/async-values/vue/example1.vue","breadcrumb":["Cell Features","Async values"],"guide":"guides/cell-features/async-values/async-values.md","guideTitle":"Async values","exampleId":"example1","exampleTitle":"Standard example","docPermalink":"/async-values","lang":"Vue 3"}
